## Outcome and evidence

- Every local check had passed before the platform review: sql_lint, base_check (A + C), fact_check, persona check-sql, the hardness gate, the solver contract, the injection gate (37/37) and several red-team rounds. The platform still found eight seeded facts that contradicted base records.
