## 27. What Opus 5.5 did in one run (trace-specific)

- It read the hub and every record the hub names first, then enumerated the named container with scripts: 632 Linear
  comment reads over 592 issues, a running decisions file and a coverage self-audit. Volume added calls, not risk.
